//--------------------------------------------------------------------
//TITLE:	GTA:SA ".pnach" & In-Game Cheats
//Author: 	TKBS
//DATE: 	2025
//GAME: 	GTA:SA PAL 2004 (PAL BLACK) - Hybrid (60hz Y POS patch)
//CRC:		85A76633 && A1B3F232
//INFO:		Cheats & Codes for PAL. New + organising existing ones + original values data for finding in other versions, regions.
//Credits:	TKBS = ".pnach" & ".ct" ".scm" cheats, Documentation, scans, Modkit.
//Credits:	AR Max CD, respective authors for other stuff.
//Links:  	info on pnach: https://slymods.info/wiki/Guide:Writing_pnach_files#Increment_/_Decrement

//Notes:	To Convert PAL to NTSC (v1 = +100) || (NTSC v2 = A90) || palv1 -> Pal v2 not done.

//Known Issues:
// [1]	NTSC has joker commands, i do not know how to make joker commands for other games which limits the cheats i can make, luckily trial and error with ntsc -> offset for SA gave a pal result.
//		D1700942 - D0700A42 = FF FF00 || (D170 - 100 = D070) && (0942 + 100 = A42), I have no idea why or how this offset calculation works (how to do this in other games?).

