// * maybe codes here to convert to pal: https://www.european-codebase.de/daten.php?system=ps2&act=detail1&id=8947
// * BROKEN BULLSHIT Codes from online ... not worth the hassle, sites are gone, and codes are alwasy wrong anyway.
