//--------------------------------------------------------------------
//------------------------ Territory Controls--------------------
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
// * 3 x Cheats for territory controls.
// 1. Spawn enemies if not present
// 2. Auto-Complete "this hood is yours"
// 3. Prevent hood from being attacked
// * This should Allow you to auto complete gang war areas when inside them.
// * codes should be disabled after use
// * Follow the steps provided;-
//---------------------------------------------------------------

//Step 1: Trigger enemies to arrive in an area if they are not present (When inside area)
//patch=1,EE,2066C8E0,extended,0000001

//Step 2: Auto-Complete the waves (When gang war is provoked, triggered - do not enter the area! )
// * set 0000000# to 2 = 1st wave done , 4 = 2nd wave done  , 0000006  = "this hood is yours"
//patch=1,EE,2066C8C8,extended,0000006

// Display territory areas:
//patch=1,EE,2066C8A4,extended,00000001

